[09:47:08] Health:short:Death Bob kills Rhanald at-Marimah [bandit] with a keen cutting blade: the edge shears through Rhanald at-Marimah [bandit]'s left arm at the elbow and on into Rhanald at-Marimah [bandit]'s side; the forearm hangs by a strip of skin below a stump of bone and muscle. Blood pours out in a dark sheet, the iron stench of it thick on the air, and Rhanald at-Marimah [bandit]'s screams fade to a whimper as Rhanald at-Marimah [bandit] dies. In death Rhanald at-Marimah [bandit]'s bowels and bladder let go, and the stench of shit and piss joins the smell of blood.
