[09:47:32] Health:short:Death Skadi kills Zhiranaz [bandit] with a sharp stabbing point: the point opens the great vessel inside Zhiranaz [bandit]'s right arm; blood jets out in bright spurts with every heartbeat and the arm goes white and limp. Zhiranaz [bandit] clutches at it, screaming, the smell of blood thick around Zhiranaz [bandit], until Zhiranaz [bandit]'s grip slackens and Zhiranaz [bandit] slumps dead in a red pool.
[09:47:32] Health:direct:Start Bob hits Zhiranaz [bandit] with a keen cutting blade hitting Zhiranaz [bandit]'s back and lips across flesh that is already cut. The blade finds the open wound again, and Zhiranaz [bandit] cries out as the pain flares white-hot. The smell of blood thickens in the air.
